  "changes": [
    "Restore the Dusty correction toggle while retaining launcher control over loading and Harmony patch installation.",
    "Default correction to On and honor saved Enabled/FixEnabled preferences. Disable releases the override immediately; enable resumes on the next healthy guarded station update.",
    "Keep logging level, Trace interval and reset; update publishing text, launcher-precedence checks and package."
  ],
  "validation": {
    "compile": "not-run",
    "offline": "passed",
    "in_game": "not-run",
    "notes": [
      "Real-game reference compilation not run: game assemblies unavailable. C# 5 compilation against explicit test doubles passed with warnings treated as errors.",
      "GitHub Actions run 40081635985, job 120836232635, source 3de7a3fe04a0e84820f6cc62ac5e6614652ba02e: 27 scenarios and 75 assertions passed; player source unchanged since the run.",
      "Offline tests confirm menu setters cannot install patches or create the loader lifecycle host, a loaded mod honors correction-off, and live toggle/reset resumes correction under the existing guards.",
      "Exact ownership guard, three hooks, unchanged diagnostic implementation/license/preview, identity/version consistency, ZIP CRC and exact member bytes checked."
    ]
  },
  "known_issues": [
    "Real UBOAT compilation and in-game launcher/menu/audio verification remain pending before Workshop upload. Test doubles do not verify real game APIs, Unity lifetimes, Harmony or actual Dusty UI.",
    "Existing diagnostic and correction preferences are preserved. Dusty stored values apply on first panel scan; other hulls/equipment and multiplayer combinations remain unverified."
  ],
